<title>UK: Dresdner unit sets 100 mln mark zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner unit sets 100 mln mark zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *100 MLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    17.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO COUPON   ISS PRICE  87.40     PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AA+   DENOMS (K) ONE	 LISTING     FFT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES     *REDEMPTION 100 PCT IN MARKS OR 57 PCT IN U.S.</p>
<p>		DOLLARS AT BONDHOLDERS CHOICE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
